## Architecture — Pipeline Flow

```
User Query
    │
    ▼
sales-orchestrator  ─── classifies query, decomposes tasks
    │
    ▼
lead-scraper        ─── finds B2B leads via web search
    │
    ▼
lead-verifier       ⛔ MANDATORY QUALITY GATE
    │                  ├── filters spam (confidence 0.0)
    │                  ├── rejects irrelevant companies
    │                  └── passes only verified leads (confidence ≥ 0.5)
    │
    ▼
outreach-drafter    ─── drafts personalized messages per verified lead
    │
    ▼
deal-closer         ─── follow-up cadence + objection handling playbook
    │
    ▼
Synthesized Report  ─── with ALL source URLs
```

## Critical Rule Verified
✅ **Every lead passes through lead-verifier before outreach-drafter** — confirmed by live test where `Faketech` was rejected at confidence 0.0 and blocked from outreach. Only `deepset` (confidence 0.85) reached the outreach stage. No unverified leads in outreach.
